  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Micronutrient Supplementation and Stunting Alleviation Programs in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia supports Indonesia&#x2019;s efforts on challenging and complex nutrition issues and contributes to Indonesia&#x2019;s efforts to achieve the nutrition priorities of the National Medium Term Development Plans (2015-2019 and 2020 &#x2013; 2024) in selected districts in East Java, West Java and East Nusa Tenggara. The Micronutrient Supplementation for Reducing Mortality and Morbidity in Indonesia (MITRA) and MITRA Youth programs focus on improving access to health services, micronutrient supply chain management, and positive nutrition behaviour changes for children, pregnant women, and adolescent girls. Additionally, the Better Investment for Stunting Alleviation (BISA) program continues these efforts by supporting local leaders to develop more efficient and effective policies and resources to ensure sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
